              "text": "第1章 反派魔法少女"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c01",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 1,
              "paragraph": 2,
              "text": "严正声明：本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在任何未成年人！"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c01",
